# Mobile screens

Edit the screen HTML for layout. Keep behavior in the colocated `.js` and styles in the colocated `.css`.

- Preserve `data-goto`, `data-screen`, and `data-landing-*` hooks
- Complete-profile dropdowns and document sheet stay in `onboarding/shared/`
- AI verify and account lock stay in `complete-documents/`
- Login is linked from landing; do not add it to the onboarding stepper unless asked
- Do not reintroduce JS-rendered markup for these screens
